a knife, a chainsaw-sword (chainsword), an axe, a big-ass hammer, and a few different guns. \n\nAs far as role-playing action shooters go, I'd give it a 7/10. It's really entertaining, and a lot of fun. However, the action isn't \"blow you away\" amazing or anything new or special. The storyline is decent, but rather short, so expect to get through the main campaign in less than 20 hours. I played on easy mode, and it was still challenging in some parts (mostly do to being overwhelmed by the shear number of enemies in fights). \n\nIt's worth buying on sale, but not really for full price. The DLC is all for the online multiplayer part of the game. I did not play this, and only played the single player campaign. That being said, I will update this review when I get around to playing the PvP aspect. \n\n\"Life is the Emperor's currency. Spend it well.\"", "timestamp_created": 1529541612, "timestamp_updated": 1529541612, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "42849729", "author": {"steamid": "76561198062835442", "personaname": "OddOne0_0", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/DasFesh/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 60, "playtime_forever": 1228, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 135, "last_played": 1740006405, "avatar": "e5140124dc5adfad33c6b652c7c7566031fd5f54"}, "language": "english", "review": "Another ♥♥♥♥♥♥ action game.", "timestamp_created": 1529440013, "timestamp_updated": 1529440013, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.338141411542892456", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck":